 "subtitle": "What share of e-receipt spend goes to Steam, and how is it trending Y/Y? Slice (US) and Fox (EU5), with card (Consumer Edge US, Fable EU5) as a check; 364-day Y/Y.",
 "owner": "fintan.creedon@srsfund.com",
 "dashboard_type": "workflow",
